{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324150/extras/01gif.gif?t=1748931601\" /><br><strong>Neuroshima Hex</strong> is a tactical <strong>turn-based strategy</strong> game based on a bestselling board game set in a unique universe that has gained recognition among players worldwide. Now, for the first time, it's available on PC in a full digital edition \u2013 <i>featuring single-player, local multiplayer, and online PvP modes</i>.<br><br>Take command of one of the factions and face off against rival armies \u2013 including the legendary <i>Moloch</i>, a network of automated machines that have rebelled against humanity. Every match is a fast-paced, intense battle of tactics, planning, and anticipating your opponent's moves.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324150/extras/02gif.gif?t=1748931601\" /><br>Step into the role of a faction leader and lead your units to victory. The reason for the fight? The classics: water, fuel, weapons, survival \u2013 everything that\u2019s precious in a world engulfed by rust, dust, and toxins.<br><br>The game\u2019s mechanics revolve around strategically placing unit and module tiles on a hexagonal board. Choose, combine, deploy, and activate \u2013 <strong>every decision matters</strong>. It\u2019s a <strong>fast-paced</strong> yet <strong>mentally demanding turn-based game</strong> where good planning is key.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324150/extras/03gif.gif?t=1748931601\" /><br>At launch, you\u2019ll have access to <strong>10 diverse armies</strong>, each with its own playstyle, strengths, weaknesses, and unique mechanics. Every faction offers a different tactical approach \u2013 from brute force to precision counters and mechanical traps.<br><br>Base game armies include: <strong>Moloch, Hegemony, Borgo, Outpost, Steel Police, Smart, Vegas, New York, Beasts, and Mississippi</strong>.<br>Additionally, we\u2019ve added <strong>3 more armies as DLC: Neojungle, Sharrash, Uranopolis</strong>.<br>Over time, we plan to <strong>add more expansions known from the board game version</strong>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324150/extras/04gif.gif?t=1748931601\" /><br>Whether you're playing for relaxation or in competitive mode \u2013 there's something here for everyone.<br><br>The game includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Advanced solo mode with AI<br></li><li><strong>Story-driven campaign</strong><br></li><li><strong>Local multiplayer</strong> on one computer<br></li><li><strong>Online PvP battles</strong></li></ul><br>That makes Neuroshima Hex perfect for both casual home play and intense online combat.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324150/extras/05gif.gif?t=1748931601\" /><br><strong>The game is available in 17 languages</strong>, including Polish, English, German, French, Japanese, Korean, and Chinese \u2013 making it accessible to players around the world.<br><br>A must-have title for:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>fans of board games and turn-based strategies<br></li><li>players who value deep tactics and asymmetric factions<br></li><li>fans of the Neuroshima universe \u2013 now also on PC!</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Prologue cleared! Mission complete!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2324150/a36000b1c159185a0f73cd7f4bf1b2524089fa14.jpg"},{"name":"Poking the Hornet's Nest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2324150/25d42a8f1d39d60dc883fae68126339687edff2e.jpg"},{"name":"Chimera Clash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2324150/6934f2844075cbbdf69b6c2d66dbfdabd4b36357.jpg"},{"name":"Bastion Breaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2324150/aa0c20a93c986869fe6049ea64deaeb09e664260.jpg"},{"name":"Predator's Demise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2324150/ae135ef3f8f2fb96096a81742ea32be6165672f2.jpg"},{"name":"Iron Guardian Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2324150/a1bb14c99624e092abc353afd04e5aafb680553d.jpg"},{"name":"So The Adventure Begins... ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2324150/e106ae2eefa84f19f7670d4febb3f6e699c5e551.jpg"},{"name":"Not so fast!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2324150/c4dfa02bef331b0dd6157c9b9623c01cf1a9ed74.jpg"},{"name":"Boooring","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2324150/bd1d4805235a27f6d9b624529a3bd6930fee33a4.jpg"},{"name":"End3r's Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2324150/245f6e8a8e55bcb993ca182c76f07abd772cd03b.jpg"}],"total":40},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2324150?t=1748931601","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748931601","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324150/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748931601","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324150/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748931601","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324