"}],"short_description":"Neuroshima Hex is a post-apocalyptic tactical game from the designers of Neuroshima, the board game. It is all about strategy and tactics on one hexagonal battlefield. The game offers many different units, technologies and special abilities that can be used for an effective strategy.","steam_appid":2324150,"support_info":{"email":"marketing@bakedgames.pl","url":"http://www.bakedgames.pl/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish, Czech, Japanese, Korean, Romanian, Hungarian","type":"game","website":"https://www.bakedgames.pl/"}